<title>USA: Asia Pulp evaluating power asset divestment.</title>
<headline>Asia Pulp evaluating power asset divestment.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asia Pulp and Paper Co Ltd said on Tuesday it is conducting a comprehensive evaluation to possibly sell or spin off its power generation assets.</p>
<p>The company said it had no intention of redeeming any capital markets debt outstanding for such a divestiture.</p>
<p>No further details of the company's plans were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
